
		LMTV4B  ECOs
[Wirelist of 1/24/80] - This is for boards marked LMTV4B

1.  7 Feb. 1981 JLK   Fix missing wires to supply -5.2V power 

	Add
	FB2 : E07-19 
	EB2 : F08-19
----------
2.  6/2/81 Taft  This fixes brain damage associated with the routing of 
		 output bits in four bit mode as opposed to "8 bit mode". 
		 The original routing conflicted with the addressing of
		 the color maps when the color was being used to load the
		 maps. For true 8 bit mode, yet more corrections will be 
		 needed later.

	Delete:			Add:

	FK1 - F11-9		FK1 - F09-14	;change COLOR runs
	FL1 - F11-7		FL1 - F09-11	;to New COLOR runs.
	FM1 - F11-5		FM1 - F09-9	;these wires are from 
	FP1 - F11-3		FP1 - F09-6	;paddles to old or new 
	FR1 - F09-14		FR1 - F11-9	;Outs.
	FS1 - F09-11		FS1 - F11-7
	FU1 - F09-9		FU1 - F11-5
	FV1 - F09-6		FV1 - F11-3

	F11-9 - D13-18		F09-14 - D13-18	;change COLOR runs to
	F11-7 - D13-16		F09-11 - D13-16	;New COLOR runs.
	F11-5 - D13-14		F09-9 - D13-14	;these wires are from
	F11-3 - D13-12		F09-6 - D13-12	;old or new Outs to
	F09-14 - D13-9    	F11-9 - D13-9	;XB Driven out.
	F09-11 - D13-7		F11-7 - D13-7
	F09-9 - D13-5		F11-5 - D13-5
	F09-6 - D13-3		F11-3 - D13-3

	F11-11 - F09-16				;Ram SHF at low
	F11-13 - F09-13				;COLOR drive in    
	F11-15 - F09-7				;to Color pics
	F11-17 - F09-4				;MUX in

	E30-17 - F11-11				;Ram SHF out to
	E28-17 - F11-13				;Low 4 Color 
	E26-17 - F11-15				;Drive in 
	E24-17 - F11-17				

				E22-17 - F11-11	;Ram SHF out to 
				E20-17 - F11-13	;Hi 4 Color 
				E18-17 - F11-15	;Drive in
				E16-17 - F11-17	

				E30-17 - F09-16	;Ram SHF out to
				E28-17 - F09-13	;Lo COLOR
				E26-17 - F09-7	;in at MUX
				E24-17 - F09-4

RAM SHF at high COLOR drv in to Color pix MUX in is already run.
